          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "descriptions",
          "text": "A small boy comes to the music room. \"Hey, what is your favorite color?\" I ask. He says yellow, but his guitar is white. \"Oh, it is very nice!\" I say. He is shy and plays a slow song. At the end, everyone says, \"Wow!\" The boy smiles and says, \"Thank you.\"",
